    "comments": [
      {
        "id": "5e65838e-fc88-4f87-94ec-ae119c9e5a55",
        "body": "Implemented the DIFF-1 tag-based npm publishing pipeline locally, limited to pipeline changes as requested.\n\nWhat changed:\n- Added `.github/workflows/publish-tag.yml`, modeled on Superfunctions' `<package-slug>-v<semver>` release flow.\n- Added `release-packages.json` mappings for `diffpanel`, `@diffpanel/git`, and `@diffpanel/storage` using tags `diffpanel-vX.Y.Z`, `diffpanel-git-vX.Y.Z`, and `diffpanel-storage-vX.Y.Z`.\n- Added `scripts/resolve-release-tag.mjs` to validate tag shape, configured package identity, non-private status, repository-contained paths, and exact manifest-version matches.\n- The workflow checks out the actual tag (including manual retries), installs/builds/tests the selected package in isolation, packs it, verifies that exact tarball in a clean external npm fixture, then publishes that tarball with the existing `NPM_TOKEN` secret.\n\nLocal verification:\n- Valid resolver case passed for `diffpanel-v0.0.1`; malformed tag, mismatched version, and private-package cases all failed as intended.\n- Core build passed.\n- Core tests passed: 2 files, 14 tests.\n- `diffpanel@0.0.1` packed successfully, installed in a clean temporary project, and imported successfully (23 exports).\n- Workflow YAML parsing and whitespace checks passed.\n- No npm publish, tag creation, release, branch, commit, push, or PR was performed.\n\nKnown limitations / follow-ups:\n- `@diffpanel/git` and `@diffpanel/storage` remain intentionally blocked by the resolver because their manifests are still private at `0.0.0`; their package/dependency preparation is outside this pipeline-only change.\n- The full `pnpm validate` gate cannot start because the pre-existing local `packages/core/package.json` rename to `diffpanel` collides with the existing `apps/vscode/package.json` name `diffpanel`. I preserved that existing edit and did not expand scope into package metadata changes.\n- The GitHub-hosted workflow and secret-backed publish step remain unexecuted by design.\n\nThe pipeline work is local and awaiting approval before creating the exact `DIFF-1` branch and pull request.\n",
