**Require an exact Git tag before checkout.**

For `workflow_dispatch`, `RELEASE_TAG` can contain a branch name such as `diffpanel-v0.0.2`. `actions/checkout` accepts that value as a branch or tag ref. `resolve-release-tag.mjs` validates only the name and package version. A matching branch can therefore reach publication without an identically named Git tag.

