<pre>
<b><i>worktreeSnapshotMatches</i></b> re-reads only entries in <b><i>files</i></b>, while <b><i>captureChangedScope</i></b> puts
over-limit and unsupported paths solely in <b><i>skipped</i></b>. If a skipped file changes after capture
