7\. Corrupt content remains marked ready <code>🐞 Bug</code> <code>☼ Reliability</code>

<pre>
<b><i>assertManifestBlobsExist</i></b> validates blob-name syntax and calls <b><i>stat()</i></b> during recovery, but never
hashes the stored bytes against the manifest hash. When an on-disk blob is modified in place, its
prepared or ready run remains usable after restart until <b><i>getRunBlob</i></b> detects the mismatch during a
later content request.
