Garbage collection can delete blobs written by a concurrent run before that run records its database references.

## Fix Focus Areas
- packages/storage/src/store.ts[86-197]
- packages/storage/src/store.ts[340-367]

## Recommended Fix
Coordinate blob creation, reference insertion, and garbage collection with a database-backed lock or pending-reference mechanism. Ensure a blob becomes protected before it is visible to collection, and remove that protection only after the run transaction commits or rolls back.
```

