## Recommended Fix
Serialize recovery and write operations using a cross-process lock, or record pending runs and temporary writes in SQLite before creating them. Recovery should only delete artifacts proven stale, such as unowned entries older than a safe threshold, rather than every currently unregistered directory or temporary file.
```

