     1	# @diffpanel/git
     2	
     3	Bounded, cancellation-aware Git capture for Diffpanel worktree, staged,
     4	commit-range, and repository snapshots.
     5	
     6	```ts
     7	import { captureReview } from "@diffpanel/git";
     8	
     9	const capture = await captureReview(
    10	  { kind: "worktree", repoPath: process.cwd() },
    11	  { signal: AbortSignal.timeout(30_000) },
    12	);
    13	```
    14	
    15	Capture follows neither repository-relative traversal nor worktree symlinks,
    16	enforces configurable file/output budgets, and retries mutable worktree reads
    17	when the snapshot changes during capture. Requires Node.js 22.13 or newer.
