     3	Bounded, cancellation-aware Git capture for Diffpanel worktree, staged,
     4	commit-range, and repository snapshots.
     5	
     6	```ts
     7	import { captureReview } from "@diffpanel/git";
     8	
     9	const capture = await captureReview(
